{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beneath a desolate surface, a mine experiences a strange disruption. You volunteer to investigate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Mindful of Him</i> is a short, free-to-play, science fiction narrative game in which you must uncover what happened to the facility before your arrival. It is a first-person exploration game with no combat or puzzles, based entirely around dialogue and text-driven interactions with your environment and other characters, and incorporating player choice in subtle, cumulative ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How will you confront what still lingers in the dark? Will you tell the world what you saw? Will you even make it out?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i>&quot;What is man, that you are mindful of him?&quot;</i></u></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3869470?t=1757693725","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3869470?t=1757693725","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869470/9a5529e067df6455ae95cb7b11e3010b59840ddd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757693725","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869470/9a5529e067df6455ae95cb7b11e3010b59840ddd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757693725","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Themes relating to death, murder, and suicide."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beneath a desolate surface, a mine experiences a strange disruption. You volunteer to investigate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Mindful of Him</i> is a short, free-to-play, science fiction narrative game in which you 